etter California)’라","date":"2026-03-26T06:51:59.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/international/international_general/2026/03/26/GI4DANJZGBSWEMBUME4GEOBVME/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"국제","categories":["international"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/international/?outputType=xml"},"title":"이란 대사 “한국은 비적대국… 미국 주도 합의에 참여 말라”","partialText":"","date":"2026-03-26T05:41:44.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/international/international_general/2026/03/26/BX6PBTFALREBTHWZNVZFOS2GFY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"국제","categories":["international"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/international/?outputType=xml"},"title":"한·중, 中중관촌서 피지컬 AI 협력 논의","partialText":"","date":"2026-03-26T05:07:36.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/international/international_general/2026/03/26/6Z73CH5HIJGMJBOQ32E2CX4G7Y/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"국제","categories":["international"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/international/?outputType=xml"},"title":"텅 빈 두바이 쇼핑몰… 명품 산업도 전쟁 유탄","partialText":"","date":"2026-03-26T05:03:48.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/international/international_general/2026/03/26/2ECVRMFL4JFZHIPAWF3JUOF3AQ/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"국제","categories":["international"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/international/?outputType=xml"},"title":"중동 6개국 “자위권 있다”...이란에 군사 대응 경고","partialText":"","date":"2026-03-26T02:53:56.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/international/international_general/2026/03/26/O7RU4XQKORGC5PTEXXSKVRP2AM/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"국제","cate